{"seq":3,"slug":"inventory-provision-finance-link","title":"存货跌价拨备与财务衔接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-health-obsolete-diagnosis/capital-attribution/inventory-provision-finance-link","wordCount":1880,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"存货跌价拨备与财务衔接\">存货跌价拨备与财务衔接</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>库存健康诊断最终要落到财务账上，衔接点是<strong>存货跌价准备</strong>。这不是可选项：只要库存的可变现净值低于成本，准则就要求计提，且这个动作会直接吃掉当期利润。诊断系统与财务系统的分工是：诊断侧提供<strong>逐 SKU 的可变现净值估计与库龄证据</strong>，财务侧按准则与内控要求做计提与披露。两边的数据契约如果没定好，会持续出现「运营说库存健康、财务说已减值 30%」的分裂。</p>\n<p>准则依据是 IAS 2。按 <a href=\"https://www.ifrs.org/issued-standards/list-of-standards/ias-2-inventories/\">IAS 2 Inventories</a>，存货「are measured at the lower of cost and net realisable value」；NRV 的定义基于「estimated selling price in the ordinary course of business」，再减去「estimated completion costs and costs needed to make the sale」；当 NRV 低于成本时发生减值（「a write-down occurs」），损失「recognised as an expense in the period the write-down or loss occurs」。成本分配上，不可互换存货用个别认定，可互换存货用「the first-in, first-out or weighted average cost formula」。</p>\n<p>美国准则下的口径与 IFRS 有细节差异。按 <a href=\"https://www.sec.gov/interps/account/sabcodet5.htm\">SEC 工作人员会计公告汇编 Topic 5.BB</a> 的表述，当商品效用低于成本时「departure from the cost basis of pricing the inventory is required when the utility of the goods is no longer as great as its cost」，差额「shall be recognized as a loss of the current period」，并且「such reduced amount is to be considered the cost for subsequent accounting purposes」。最后一句是关键的工程约束：<strong>减值后的金额成为新的成本基准</strong>，意味着减值不是可以随意回拨的估值准备——后续不能因为市场回暖就简单冲回。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[库存账面成本&lt;br/&gt;落地成本] --&gt; C{NRV &lt; 成本?}&#10;  B[预计可变现净值 NRV] --&gt; C&#10;  B1[预计售价&lt;br/&gt;正常经营] --&gt; B&#10;  B2[减: 至完工成本] --&gt; B&#10;  B3[减: 销售费用与佣金] --&gt; B&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[维持成本计量]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E[计提跌价准备]&#10;  E --&gt; F[当期损益&lt;br/&gt;资产减值损失]&#10;  E --&gt; G[新成本基准]&#10;  G --&gt; H[后续期间不可简单冲回]&#10;  E --&gt; I[披露: 计提金额与依据]&#10;  J[库龄分布证据] --&gt; B&#10;  K[滞销归因结论] --&gt; B&#10;  L[清仓报价/成交价] --&gt; B1\">graph TD\n  A[库存账面成本&lt;br/&gt;落地成本] --&gt; C{NRV &lt; 成本?}\n  B[预计可变现净值 NRV] --&gt; C\n  B1[预计售价&lt;br/&gt;正常经营] --&gt; B\n  B2[减: 至完工成本] --&gt; B\n  B3[减: 销售费用与佣金] --&gt; B\n  C --&gt;|否| D[维持成本计量]\n  C --&gt;|是| E[计提跌价准备]\n  E --&gt; F[当期损益&lt;br/&gt;资产减值损失]\n  E --&gt; G[新成本基准]\n  G --&gt; H[后续期间不可简单冲回]\n  E --&gt; I[披露: 计提金额与依据]\n  J[库龄分布证据] --&gt; B\n  K[滞销归因结论] --&gt; B\n  L[清仓报价/成交价] --&gt; B1</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>计量口径</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>NRV 估计方法</th>\n<th>计提比例参考</th>\n<th>证据来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正常在售</td>\n<td>库龄 &lt; 90 天</td>\n<td>正常售价 − 销售费用</td>\n<td>0%</td>\n<td>近期成交价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>季节性滞销</td>\n<td>季节因子低、库龄 90–180 天</td>\n<td>旺季售价折让 10%–20%</td>\n<td>0%–15%</td>\n<td><a href=\"slowmove-attribution-selection-price\">滞销归因</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滞销超储</td>\n<td>覆盖期 &gt; 目标 2 倍</td>\n<td>促销价 − 促销成本</td>\n<td>15%–40%</td>\n<td>促销历史折让率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>呆滞</td>\n<td>连续无动销 &gt; 180 天</td>\n<td>清仓价 − 清仓费用</td>\n<td>40%–70%</td>\n<td>清仓成交价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>死库存候选</td>\n<td>过期/EOL/召回</td>\n<td>残值或报废价</td>\n<td>70%–100%</td>\n<td>报废/捐赠估值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在途</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>按目的地 NRV 判断</td>\n<td>同目的地口径</td>\n<td>需单独评估落地成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"可变现净值的估计方法\">可变现净值的估计方法</h2><h3 id=\"分层估计而非一刀切\">分层估计而非一刀切</h3><p>NRV 的估计必须按库存状态分层，因为不同层的证据强度差异巨大。<strong>最上层用市场证据</strong>（近期真实成交价、平台同款售价），<strong>中间层用历史折让率</strong>（该品类过去 12 个月促销平均折让），<strong>最下层用处置价</strong>（清仓渠道报价、报废残值）。证据越弱，估计的保守程度应越高，这就是上表计提比例逐层上升的原因。</p>\n<h3 id=\"从库龄到-nrv-的映射\">从库龄到 NRV 的映射</h3><p>库龄本身不是 NRV 的证据，但它是最可靠的<strong>触发信号</strong>。标准做法是建立一张「库龄桶 → NRV 上限」的映射表，把 <a href=\"../inventory-health-metric/age-bucket-dio-turnover\">库龄分布与 DIO</a> 的库龄桶边界与上表的计提比例对齐。这张表的三个输入必须来自同一个数据源：库龄桶、<a href=\"../obsolete-excess-detect/slowmoving-deadstock-rule-alert\">呆滞判定</a> 状态、以及近期实际成交价。</p>\n<h3 id=\"归因结论对计提比例的影响\">归因结论对计提比例的影响</h3><p>同样是 180 天库龄的呆滞，归因为<strong>季节</strong>与归因为<strong>选品失误</strong>的 NRV 估计应显著不同。季节性的可以按下一旺季正常售价估算，只需承担资金时间价值损失；选品失误的在目标市场的需求结构已消失，应按清仓价估算。这是 <a href=\"slowmove-attribution-selection-price\">滞销归因</a> 直接进入财务计量的地方——归因不是运营的自我安慰，它是计提比例的证据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据契约与系统衔接\">数据契约与系统衔接</h2><h3 id=\"诊断侧提供给财务的最小数据集\">诊断侧提供给财务的最小数据集</h3><p>诊断系统不应把整个库存明细推给财务系统，而应提供一个<strong>窄接口</strong>：逐 SKU 的可变现净值估计与其证据。财务系统按此计提并做披露。这个窄接口遵循最小字段原则，也让财务侧的审计线索更清晰。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE fin_nrv_estimate (&#10;  period             CHAR(7)       NOT NULL,   -- YYYY-MM&#10;  sku_id             VARCHAR(64)  NOT NULL,&#10;  legal_entity_id    VARCHAR(32)  NOT NULL,&#10;  qty_on_hand        DECIMAL(14,3) NOT NULL,&#10;  cost_landed        DECIMAL(14,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  age_bucket         VARCHAR(12)  NOT NULL,&#10;  deadstock_state    VARCHAR(16),              -- SLOW_MOVING / DEAD_CANDIDATE / NONE&#10;  primary_cause      VARCHAR(16),              -- 见 fact_slowmove_attribution&#10;  nrv_unit_estimate  DECIMAL(14,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  nrv_method         VARCHAR(24)  NOT NULL,    -- MARKET_PRICE / HIST_DISCOUNT / CLEARANCE / SALVAGE&#10;  evidence_ref       VARCHAR(256) NOT NULL,&#10;  estimated_at       TIMESTAMP    NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (period, sku_id, legal_entity_id)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fin_nrv_estimate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  period</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- YYYY-MM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  legal_entity_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  qty_on_hand        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cost_landed        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  age_bucket         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  deadstock_state    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- SLOW_MOVING / DEAD_CANDIDATE / NONE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  primary_cause      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 见 fact_slowmove_attribution</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  nrv_unit_estimate  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  nrv_method         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- MARKET_PRICE / HIST_DISCOUNT / CLEARANCE / SALVAGE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_ref       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  estimated_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">period</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, sku_id, legal_entity_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个字段值得特别说明：<code>nrv_method</code> 让财务能按证据强度复核；<code>evidence_ref</code> 指向具体证据（成交记录、清仓报价单编号），满足审计追溯；<code>estimated_at</code> 让财务能识别「这个估计是季度内的还是过期的」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与-库存资金占用-1_inventory-carrying-cost-capital-md-的关系\">与 <a href=\"inventory-carrying-cost-capital\">库存资金占用</a> 的关系</h3><p>持有成本与跌价准备是<strong>两个不同的损失通道</strong>，必须分别核算，不能互相替代。持有成本是<strong>时间流逝造成的持续消耗</strong>（按费率 × 天数），跌价准备是<strong>价值基准的一次性下调</strong>。一个 SKU 可以同时产生两者：先把 30% 的货值计入持有成本，再因 NRV 跌破成本而计提 40% 减值——两者相加才是这个 SKU 的真实亏损。把它们混在一起会让「清仓是否划算」的判断失去依据。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Transfer_pricing\">转让定价</a> 在跨境集团内部还会制造额外复杂度：该来源指出这类规则是「rules and methods for pricing transactions within and between enterprises under common ownership or control」，其影响是「determine in large part the income and expenses, and therefore taxable profits, of associated enterprises」。当库存从一个国家实体转移到另一个时，转移价格决定了哪个实体的存货成本更高、跌价准备计提更多——税务与会计口径需要协调。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计提节奏与重估\">计提节奏与重估</h2><h3 id=\"月度计提-季度复核\">月度计提、季度复核</h3><p>准则要求在每个报告期评估 NRV，实务上采用<strong>月度计提、季度复核</strong>：月度按库龄桶映射表机械计提（保证及时性），季度做一次人工复核（保证合理性）。复核的重点是「异常计提」——某个 SKU 的计提比例突然跳变、或某品类的计提总额与库龄分布不匹配。</p>\n<h3 id=\"冲回与准则限制\">冲回与准则限制</h3><p>IFRS 下 NRV 回升时可以冲回，但冲回后的金额不能超过原成本。美国准则下按上述 SEC 工作人员的指引，减值后「such reduced amount is to be considered the cost for subsequent accounting purposes」，即新的成本基准已经确立，后续市场回暖不能简单冲回。<strong>工程约束是：系统必须保留原始成本与新成本基准两个字段</strong>，否则更换准则或做税务申报时无法还原。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;entity&quot;: &quot;EU_OPS_GmbH&quot;,&#10;  &quot;period&quot;: &quot;2026-09&quot;,&#10;  &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;IFRS_IAS2&quot;,&#10;  &quot;cost_basis_tracking&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;original_landed_cost_field&quot;: &quot;cost_landed&quot;,&#10;    &quot;current_basis_field&quot;: &quot;cost_basis_current&quot;,&#10;    &quot;written_down_flag&quot;: &quot;is_written_down&quot;,&#10;    &quot;reversal_allowed&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;reversal_cap&quot;: &quot;original_landed_cost&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;provision_rates_by_bucket&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;0-30&quot;: 0.0,&#10;    &quot;31-60&quot;: 0.0,&#10;    &quot;61-90&quot;: 0.05,&#10;    &quot;91-180&quot;: 0.25,&#10;    &quot;180+&quot;: 0.55&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;cause_adjustment&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;SEASON&quot;: -0.1,&#10;    &quot;FORECAST&quot;: 0.0,&#10;    &quot;PRICING&quot;: 0.05,&#10;    &quot;ASSORTMENT&quot;: 0.15&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;controls&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;four_eyes_above_amount&quot;: 50000,&#10;    &quot;evidence_required_for_nonzero&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;quarterly_manual_review&quot;: true&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"entity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EU_OPS_GmbH\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"period\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"IFRS_IAS2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"cost_basis_tracking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"original_landed_cost_field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cost_landed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"current_basis_field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cost_basis_current\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"written_down_flag\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"is_written_down\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"reversal_allowed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"reversal_cap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"original_landed_cost\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"provision_rates_by_bucket\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"0-30\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"31-60\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"61-90\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"91-180\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"180+\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.55</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"cause_adjustment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"SEASON\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"FORECAST\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"PRICING\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"ASSORTMENT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.15</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"controls\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"four_eyes_above_amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"evidence_required_for_nonzero\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"quarterly_manual_review\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>cause_adjustment</code> 把归因结论转成计提比例的调整量，是本节与 <a href=\"slowmove-attribution-selection-price\">滞销归因</a> 的接口定义。控制项 <code>four_eyes_above_amount</code> 与 <code>evidence_required_for_nonzero</code> 则是内控要求——存货减值是管理层判断领域，必须有审批与证据链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>存货按「成本与可变现净值孰低」计量，NRV 定义为正常经营下的预计售价减去至完工与销售成本。</li>\n<li>减值损失计入当期损益，且减值后金额成为新的成本基准，后续不可简单冲回。</li>\n<li>NRV 估计分层：上层用市场成交价、中层用历史折让率、下层用清仓与残值，证据越弱越保守。</li>\n<li>库龄桶是触发信号不是证据，须与呆滞状态、实际成交价同源。</li>\n<li><a href=\"slowmove-attribution-selection-price\">滞销归因</a> 结论直接调整计提比例，季节 vs 选品失误可差数倍。</li>\n<li>持有成本与跌价准备是两个损失通道，必须分别核算，相加才是真实亏损。</li>\n<li>月度按映射表计提、季度人工复核，系统须同时保留原始成本与新成本基准字段。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"存货跌价拨备与财务衔接","id":"存货跌价拨备与财务衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"可变现净值的估计方法","id":"可变现净值的估计方法"},{"level":3,"text":"分层估计而非一刀切","id":"分层估计而非一刀切"},{"level":3,"text":"从库龄到 NRV 的映射","id":"从库龄到-nrv-的映射"},{"level":3,"text":"归因结论对计提比例的影响","id":"归因结论对计提比例的影响"},{"level":2,"text":"数据契约与系统衔接","id":"数据契约与系统衔接"},{"level":3,"text":"诊断侧提供给财务的最小数据集","id":"诊断侧提供给财务的最小数据集"},{"level":3,"text":"与 [库存资金占用](1_inventory-carrying-cost-capital.md) 的关系","id":"与-库存资金占用-1_inventory-carrying-cost-capital-md-的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"计提节奏与重估","id":"计提节奏与重估"},{"level":3,"text":"月度计提、季度复核","id":"月度计提-季度复核"},{"level":3,"text":"冲回与准则限制","id":"冲回与准则限制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"滞销归因：选品/定价/预测/季节","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-health-obsolete-diagnosis/capital-attribution/slowmove-attribution-selection-price"},"next":{"title":"调拨/促销/清仓建议（建议层）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-health-obsolete-diagnosis/recommendation-dashboard/transfer-promotion-markdown-suggest"}}